.DS_Store

# Personal/working files that don't belong on the public site.
# This folder is a git repo now (pushed to GitHub for hosting), so anything
# dropped in here gets swept up by `git add` unless it's excluded below.
# Whole file *types* are blocked, not just today's specific filenames, so a
# future CV draft or video doesn't need a new rule to stay private.
#
# If you genuinely want to publish a specific PDF or video one day (e.g. a
# preprint), add it with: git add -f path/to/file.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.key
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
